# SparkESP32: the ESP32-C6 display enumerates as an Espressif USB-Serial/JTAG
# CDC-ACM device. ModemManager (active on DGX OS) probes new ttyACM ports with
# AT commands, which would spray garbage into the display's console. Keep out.
SUBSYSTEM=="tty", ATTRS{idVendor}=="303a", ATTRS{idProduct}=="1001", ENV{ID_MM_DEVICE_IGNORE}="1"
